      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: I used to use a mod that handled this perfectly with no issues. A local disabling of video players would be exactly what people need. There are other ways about the same goal that i've seen but devs really need to do something.",
