  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-04T17:57:50.120Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be really helpful for people who play the game with internet that isnt perfect and limited data to be able to be able to change the whitelist of what URLs are able to get through the filter.  For me specifically, I only get 50 GB a month which has to encompass everything I do online, and being able to prevent vrchat worlds from loading youtube/spotify ect videos would go a long way towards me being able to use the app for longer.",
